From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:17:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] eagler: No Server Links button beside an Eagler server's own
 buttons

An EaglerXServer that sends its pause menu gives the player its links
there; the game's Server Links button repeated them.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java
index 02aeb84f1c331aa080a5041fbc7e137d8b13884d..e351fdd577916f207930496a87754ece221066bb 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java
@@ -203,2 +203,7 @@
         ServerLinks serverLinks = this.minecraft.player.connection.serverLinks();
+        // Incari start: no Server Links button where an Eagler server's own buttons take its place
+        if (incari.client.eagler.PauseMenuHooks.replacesServerLinks()) {
+            return Optional.empty();
+        }
+        // Incari end
         return !serverLinks.isEmpty() ? dialogRegistry.get(Dialogs.SERVER_LINKS) : Optional.empty();
